{
  "id": "LUK.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 11",
  "verseCount": 53,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghoanaal buuneeda mooshta ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweecha ghamwaash Yesu ASEETA, ama ahiit goobearsa giinealaneanagi bea jeeda ginealangaaschi nea gwayeesha, “Ng'utamiida, anaaleasa mooshta ASEETA gawuurji gida anaalda Yohana ginealangaaschi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha saawa, “Iyoamwaashchi ASEETA gooyeenyi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha saawa, “Gajea ng'eaha aba jeedeang'wa mideawa siituupchi, jea gaweesa bugusta eaweeda ak gwayeesha, ‘Siida eaduupcheewi, nung' daalaajaneey mukaataji samwagu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba nihissean Siida eaduupcheewi ak ea meandeawani gichea dayiin madeadaanyi’; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaygwayeesha siidida mida gahiin, ‘Adiideawiichean, sijapchi gidaghuuta ak ea silili sea diibigeasu, mwammuusi dang'eat dagoonyi gil’? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geayeeshiineegwa, mayghang'eat ghoadaw gil earapeadi duupchiin ak gayghang'eat ghoadayda haleanjeeda sean gasa siisi aba gideaba mabuurnana giidiktiksiinda musooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geayeeshiineegwa, amusiischeena ak Gajeegooneegwa; agassa, ak gajadaaha; agulgula gidaghuuta, ak gajeejeaseegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba siida wassean musiischi gajeataw, nea siida gaseadayi gayghwadaah, nea siida gulgul gidaghuuta gajeejeasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajea ana ghwaani, aba jeedeang'wa ama mus orjeedaanyi ghweayeanda, ghoadaw ichibooda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghana iimus burung'nyeanda jea ghoadaw udagilba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agooga fuga munyas, iyoanaldunu gichea oatawda diibigeagwa haleanjeeda miyaas, abeeda Ghweandeang'wa mida humng'eeda mwanala muuchi ghoadawda Guroorooda Ghaydit fugiga musa ninyiin!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ea Beelsebuli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gooruuta meangeenda manda ghuuta; damanda riteawa meangeenda, deagheata gabalool siidida manda ghuutean, ak ghahamng'eanyi buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayi buuneeda mwaatkwa, “Gooruuta meangeenda aba uurda Beelsebuli, meangeenda diita hawiin;” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea Mwaatkwa, gwasimsim, nea geegasa ghoahiimda gwadeagooda leabu humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nal gidabaloola jeesinga nyaawa, gwayeesha saawa, “Iing'uchi sugoocheanduumeemba ng'eanyiinagi abeeda sugoocheanduumeeni ea maygahuuweada, nea gheeda dardaawaat gayghoabeada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara Shataani iibalaksa ak gang'uchi geaw, abeeda sugoocheanduumeadaanyi gaygamajeegiitaan? Ak goorukutaaydiin gideaba aniini gearuuti meangeenda aba uurda Beelsebuli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama iyearuuti meangeenda aba uurda Beelsebuli, diibigeagwa gooruutiideawa ng'eaha? Aba sareani gaygoorgweakseegwa fugeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama iyearuuti meangeenda aba uurda ASEETA abeeda ghoanali gideaba sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA nihisseegwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gheeda ng'eedeeda hoauur, biissa gwandeawa dabita, iifur gheanyi, haleanjeadaanyi sean gaygaba hoyyoo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geaghus iiweesa siida burdeawa uurda ak ghabwar ea ghwajoar, abeeda gayghoareat dabitaanyi sean bea ng'ucheeda, ak gwalakiisa fugaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siida meandeayeewani washteanyu gil, nea dea meaweamuudayeewani goodeariida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Biiknooda meang'nyeandeenda muy",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meang'nyeandeenda iiriteawa siida gwaneaydooschi aba ng'eanyiida manda beega gagaseada heechea gafuufa; raay gwayi, ‘Gaydabiiksa gheenyu ealeabu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iihita ghwadaah nea siipuus ak ea siitaamdaam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidaaktunu gayghamwaghaada meangeenda ispwa munyaseewa niny muuchi, ak gaweay goobiida jeedida; ak giibindeaba siidida gajea muy ea ghwanaawa diita ghayi bea mwadiin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hooseaneega huumwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damandida duu gabaloolean, ghwajaat ghuut gatmu aba jeedeaba eemeedida nea gwayeesha, “Ghang'wana jeeda jiilneey ea gidinga ireeri!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Ghang'wana fugiga iiy ng'asheega ASEETA nea ghoang'waayiin!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gasooda ng'asheega deamdeameadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea nibassa geat eemeetuw, gwayeesha, “Jeacheeng'su jeacheenga munyas gil; gaseadayi gwadeagooda ak ea manda gwadeagooda, jea eehiimsa geaghus gwadeagooda ghayi bea Yona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gida ghayi waseata Yona gwadeagooda aba heeda fuga Ninawi, ea gichea ghoawaata Orjeeda Siida gil aba jeacheeng'su. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gatmooda was sugoocheanda leabu Wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara gayghwahidu eaweeda jea eergweaksiina fugeaba jeacheeng'su ak gaygoorgweaksa; niny gwaleabu heesheagi ak ghwaan gooleeysiit weaghuumeeda Sulemani, nea hiji ging'ulayi, gwanda dea haweewa Sulemani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gay ghapka fuga Ninawi eaweeda girgweaksiindeaba jeacheeng'su ak gaygoorgweaksa; nea gwaduukuuna ng'asheega iiyiiy ng'asheega rukwiisa Yona, nea ging'ulayi, aba hiji gwanda dea haweewa Yona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gheaboong'nyeanda saseeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Manda siida jea ghoayeat gheaboong'nyeanda ak ghwayiin heeda funyaat ghana gwadukuteawa dahuuda, iissa geayiin uhuuda ghamarda ak abeeda fuga buwa gah gayghwadaah weeshinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gheaboong'nyeanda saseeda gheang'da; gheang'daang'u iimiy abeeda eara saseadaang'u gaygwanda heedeesh; ama masnu, abeeda saseadaang'u gwanda jeeda misaneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi amilmiliita adiidu ghoah weeshinda mida jeadaang'u misaneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi saseadaang'u sean iimida weeshinda nea manda hiji misana, gaygaweeshiit saseadaang'u sean, gawuurji gilabwaanyi gheaboong'nyeanda aba weeshindaanyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghoahaakta Farisaayajeega ea diinagoodiga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damani duu gabaloolean, gaguursa siyagi was Farisaayo ghwahidu gheanyi gweagiischi, gawa ak gweagiischi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghahamng'eanyi Farisaayajeandida iidaah gweagiischi nea miigoohuun geadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Ng'utamiida niny, “Agooga Farisaayajeega iissa goohuunyi badayda gikoombe ea dea gweeriida, nea jeesingeagwa ghwanyiit mareanghuumeeda ea munyinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga dasheahi! Dea sin gea jarooda mii dea sin eara geaba jihi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi oatawa haleanjeeda sisapa geadi bea ghadooweeda bea jih; abeeda gayghamiidu haleanjeeda sean aba heedeang'wa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi Farisaayajeega ashageada! Agooga aba gideaba ghoataydi aba jeeda gilatamanamughuush bea haleanjeedeang'wa iissa ghoataydi akaleala, aba seenga hamuumayga ea sooktayda ea seenga suuk bea nyeanyiida, nea ghoanung'waadi ng'asheega doobiiweadi ea bariinyeega ASEETA; ng'asheesu gamiiseegwa sinooda, nea maroosseegwa ng'asheega suurja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farisaayajeega ashageada! aba gideaba ghoabwariinyi oopiitpiidana hoorgajeega madeeda aba jeeda gealga siinealshacheewa nea geekeatooscheeweegwa aba naada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashageada! Aba gideaba noowuurjeewi bung'eadinga mwadaajiida, sik badahuuka buuneeda nea mwanala.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha siyagi aba diinagoodiga ak gwayeesha, “Giinealshoocheanda, iininyaashtunu ea niing'eaweasa eara aseasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Eara agooga diinagoodiga ashageada! Aba gideaba goosareenayi buuneeda sareenda mwoamu easar, nea agooga ea moasadi sareeni eara aba mooneanagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashageada! Aba gideaba goosinayi bung'eadinga sibanga nea ghweanigeagwa ea fuga ghayi nuus gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea agooga goowooschi muushoodiga gideaba ghoamwaschi gadiyeeda ghweanigeagwa, aba gideaba saawa gwanuus, ak goosinyi agooga bung'eadinga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi Weaghuumeeda ASEETA, ‘Gaydeajeakta sibanga ea giijasoodiga ak gaygwanuuseada mwaatkwa nea geesawan,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea foojeanda sibanga sean, geahiida ghang'eada dea sisna sindeeta ng'eanyiida, ak gajeegasa aba heedeaba jeacheeng'su, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghang'eada giihiideayda foojeanda Habeli ea gagul foojeanda Sakariya, ghayi sinuuksa dageascheeda heeda wagiida ea heeda Ghaydit. Asi huumwa gil geayeeshiineegwa, gajeegasa aba heedeaba jeacheeng'su. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diinagoodiga ashageada! Aba gideaba noogeandi gissiitina gidaghuuta fughareeda, nea agooga ea miyooweayeena gah, nea fuga weay gah ea noakghuumnyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghabeawa hoowa, gwaneaweesa muuchi ng'oorshoodiga ea Farisaayajeega ak geasasat nea geenyeari ng'asheega saang'a, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "geebassa nea geegasa ng'asheanda ramwasaat jea gwaleabu ghuutaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
